WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.640
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a Canadian comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:11.680
called “Starbuck”. Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.960
David Wozniak is a young man living&nbsp;
in Quebec, Canada. He makes money by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.840
frequently donating sperm to the LaFrance&nbsp;
clinic. At the beginning of the movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.880
he is in between one of his visits to the sperm&nbsp;
bank, pleasuring himself to pictures of women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:37.840
in a magazine. The scene shifts Twenty-three years&nbsp;
later, in 2011. David is now a middle-aged man but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:44.560
he still doesn’t have a definite job. He is woken&nbsp;
up by thugs whom he owes eighty thousand dollars.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:50.400
They dump him into the bathtub, threatening him to&nbsp;
return their money. Following the unusual morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:55.920
he goes to his parents’ butcher shop where he&nbsp;
works as a delivery man. He is forty-five minutes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:00.800
late and is yelled at for taking the delivery&nbsp;
truck home again. The workers in the shop,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:05.680
along with his father, are on a football team&nbsp;
and are about to take a team picture the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:11.040
day. David was told to pick up the jerseys for&nbsp;
the pictures three weeks ago but he still hasn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:16.080
gotten it. Everyone is tired of him for not&nbsp;
doing as told even when the job is simple. 
&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:21.040
After work, he rushes to the clothing store but&nbsp;
the owner happens to be closing it right then.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:26.000
He quickly parks his truck in the middle of the&nbsp;
road and begs the owner to give him the jerseys.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.560
The man does it out of sympathy but David&nbsp;
gets a parking ticket in the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.760
Following that, he visits several banks to&nbsp;
ask for a loan to pay off his debts. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:41.440
he doesn’t have the required collateral for them&nbsp;
to pass the loan. After facing several rejections,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:46.560
he returns home and tells his co-worker on the&nbsp;
phone that he has received the jerseys. The person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:52.320
on the other end is skeptical, knowing that David&nbsp;
isn’t reliable. Outside, his truck is taken away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:57.680
by the traffic police because he received too many&nbsp;
parking tickets. The jerseys were still in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:03.040
truck which means the team has to take pictures&nbsp;
without them. Everyone is disappointed in David,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:08.480
although they are used to his behavior. 
After that, David goes to his girlfriend Valérie’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:14.160
house. She is a police officer and is way more&nbsp;
financially independent than David. He hasn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:20.080
spoken to her in a few days which Valérie is upset&nbsp;
about. As David tries to explain himself, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:26.000
reveals that she is pregnant. David is taken aback&nbsp;
by the revelation. He cannot tell if he likes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.680
news or not. Valérie senses that he is hesitant&nbsp;
and claims that she is going to keep the child no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:37.520
matter what. Following the interaction, David goes&nbsp;
to meet his friend, The Lawyer. The lawyer has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:43.200
four kids, all of whom refuse to listen to him.&nbsp;
He has been troubled by fatherhood and suggests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:49.040
David to not have children ever in his life.&nbsp;
David, however, wants to be a father, he is only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:54.640
confused if this is the right time for him. The&nbsp;
very next morning, he goes to Valérie’s work and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.640 --> 00:03:00.400
declares to her that he is ready to be a father to&nbsp;
their child. On reaching home, he meets a man in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:05.840
a suit who introduces himself as Chamberlan.
He is the lawyer for the clinic that David used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:12.000
to donate sperm to. Between 1988 and&nbsp;
1990, David donated sperm to the bank&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.880
under the name “Starbuck”. He made over&nbsp;
six hundred and ninety-three donations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:26.000
over the period of twenty-three months. Because of&nbsp;
some kind of error, the company provided all its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:32.080
clients with David’s sperms and as a result, he&nbsp;
has fathered five hundred thirty-three children.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:37.680
Out of them, one hundred and forty-two want to&nbsp;
know his identity. But, before every donation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:42.160
David had signed a confidentiality contract,&nbsp;
according to which, the clinic isn’t allowed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:46.640
to share his personal information. Hence,&nbsp;
the hundred and forty-two children who want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:51.280
to get to know their father have sued the&nbsp;
company and their confidentiality clause so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:56.160
they would be given the information about&nbsp;
David. Hearing all this, David freaks out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:01.440
and repeatedly says that he is not Starbuck. 
After the encounter, he goes to meet his friend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:05.920
the lawyer, and tells him about the matter. The&nbsp;
lawyer wants him to file a countersuit against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:11.600
the clinic and make some money but David refuses&nbsp;
to do so. He notes down all the information about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.880
the sperm donation procedure and hands David an&nbsp;
envelope with information about all his children.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:22.480
The next morning, David decides to take a look&nbsp;
at a paper inside the envelope out of curiosity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:28.000
The paper he pulls out has information about&nbsp;
a star football player, Ricardo Donatelli.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:32.720
David realizes that he is the father of one&nbsp;
of his favorite players and rushes to tell the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:38.320
lawyer. They go to Ricardo’s game and cheer for&nbsp;
him. Now that David knows the player is his son,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.560
he is proud of his genes. At first, he had&nbsp;
decided that he won’t get involved with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:48.240
children’s lives but curiosity gets the best&nbsp;
of him. The next day pulls out a second paper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:54.000
and gets to know about Étienne, his son who works&nbsp;
at a restaurant. David goes to the said restaurant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.960
and finds Étienne arguing with someone on the&nbsp;
phone. It turns out that he is a struggling actor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:03.840
who has just missed an opportunity to audition&nbsp;
for a huge role because he is working. 
&nbsp;

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:08.480
David offers to handle the place for him while&nbsp;
he goes to the audition. Étienne believes he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:13.680
a robber who is looking for a tactic to rob their&nbsp;
shop. But when offered the delivery truck to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:18.640
to the audition, he agrees. A while later,&nbsp;
the restaurant’s owner arrives at the place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:25.280
and tells David he will fire Étienne. Hours pass&nbsp;
when Étienne finally returns and says that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:30.320
got the part. David is glad that he was able to&nbsp;
make a difference in his son’s life. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:35.920
he brings out the third paper and finds out about&nbsp;
his daughter Julie. He goes to her place as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:40.640
pizza delivery guy and finds her on the phone,&nbsp;
yelling at someone. While he is still in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:47.040
house, she locks herself in a room and overdoses&nbsp;
on a drug. David quickly gets her to the hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:52.560
The next day, Julie is sent to a rehabilitation&nbsp;
center where people assume he is her father.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:57.520
Julie doesn’t reveal the truth because she wants&nbsp;
David to sign the release papers as her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:02.480
so she can be let free. David consults with the&nbsp;
doctor and tries to convince Julie to stay at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:07.440
rehab. But the girl promises that she will be&nbsp;
better outside because she just got her dream&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:13.040
job yesterday and she doesn’t want to lose&nbsp;
it. At last, David decides to release her.
&nbsp;

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:18.160
The next morning he goes to her workplace and&nbsp;
sees she has started the job as she had promised.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:22.880
On returning home, he pins the papers with his&nbsp;
children’s information to the wall and goes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:28.480
meet them one by one. Some of them have grown&nbsp;
to be nail technicians, musicians, lifeguards,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:34.320
tour guides, and so on. He meets them all and&nbsp;
goes out of his way to help them if they need it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:38.800
One day, Valérie visits him at the shop and&nbsp;
asks him to come to the doctor’s with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:42.560
After the doctor’s appointment, they&nbsp;
go to a park and watch children play.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:47.440
Valérie is scared about the pregnancy and&nbsp;
thinks she is not ready to be a mother. David,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:53.120
on the other hand, promises to be the best father&nbsp;
and comforts her. The next day, he finds out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:59.280
one of his children named Raphael is disabled. He&nbsp;
goes to the home of disabled people and nervously&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:05.040
talks to his son. Raphael realizes that someone&nbsp;
is around but he is unable to talk or respond&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:10.640
because of his disability. David spends the day&nbsp;
talking to him, even though the kid cannot reply.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:15.760
He also feeds Raphael during lunch break.&nbsp;
The next day, while following his other son,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:20.480
David ends up at a meeting organized by all&nbsp;
the children who were born because of Starbuck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:26.800
Seeing all of his offspring in a place overwhelms&nbsp;
David and he stands up involuntarily.
&nbsp;

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:32.160
He is suddenly handed a microphone and asked&nbsp;
to speak. David tells them that he loves them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:37.520
and gives a heartfelt speech about all of them&nbsp;
being siblings. After the program, he meets Julia,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:43.200
Étienne, and other children who he has helped.
To hide his identity, he pretends to be Raphael’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:47.280
adoptive father. The children have formed&nbsp;
a community of a sort and have started to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:52.480
socialize with each other as half-siblings. When&nbsp;
David returns home that day, he is again dumped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:58.640
into the bathtub by the thugs to whom he owes&nbsp;
money. At night, one of his sons, Antonie who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:03.760
has somehow found out about his identity comes to&nbsp;
his house. He says that he doesn’t want to reveal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:09.200
David’s identity to the people and is only looking&nbsp;
to spend a few days with his biological father.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:13.920
David agrees to let him stay at the house. He and&nbsp;
Valérie go to his parents’ house for dinner that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:19.040
day. As the table erupts into friendly chatter,&nbsp;
David’s father tells them about the time David&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:23.280
bought them tickets to Italy. It turns out that&nbsp;
his parents hadn’t had a chance to go on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:28.960
honeymoon so David used all the money that he&nbsp;
collected from donating sperm to take them on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:34.320
vacation. Although no one knows where he got&nbsp;
the money from, they praise his thoughtfulness.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:39.360
Valérie looks at David differently after finding&nbsp;
out what he had done for his family. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:45.360
David and Antonie go to football practice together&nbsp;
and enjoy a father-son day. The day goes well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:51.120
until David mentions that he has to tend to his&nbsp;
“real” family now that Valérie is pregnant. 
&nbsp;

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:56.960
The following day, David’s children organize a&nbsp;
picnic. They sing, dance, eat together, and have a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:02.720
lot of fun as siblings. However, the day after the&nbsp;
event, the story of Starbuck catches the media’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:07.440
attention. Although the children didn’t mean to&nbsp;
make Starbuck look bad, the media paints him as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:13.520
pervert who used his sexuality to make money. When&nbsp;
David asks Valérie what she thinks about Starbuck,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:19.120
she claims that he is similar to a prostitute.&nbsp;
The two get into an argument about the matter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:23.040
One day, before a football practice,&nbsp;
the team is talking about Starbuck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:28.160
All of David’s teammates think he is a creep&nbsp;
and a pervert. His brother asks him if he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:33.840
ever donated but David denies having done anything&nbsp;
like that. The conversation gets heated when they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:38.560
assume he is lying. David almost attacks his&nbsp;
brother and has to be stopped by the others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:44.640
That evening, he is informed that the thugs whom&nbsp;
he owes money threatened his father and tried to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:50.320
drown him in the bathtub. If he doesn’t pay off&nbsp;
the debts soon, his entire family will suffer. 
&nbsp;

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:54.560
Hence, David goes to the lawyer and says he&nbsp;
will file a countersuit against the clinic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.520
for using his sperms unethically. He hopes that&nbsp;
after winning the lawsuit the clinic will provide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:05.120
him monetary compensation. The lawyer is happy&nbsp;
to have finally gotten a big case that will bring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:11.040
him fame if he wins. For the next few days,&nbsp;
they work very hard to create a strong case.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:16.080
The night before the ruling, they play football&nbsp;
in the pouring rain to relieve stress. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:21.840
judge finally announces that Starbuck is entirely&nbsp;
entitled to his anonymity which means the children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:27.040
will not get to see their biological father&nbsp;
unless he wants to show himself deliberately.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:33.120
David is also entitled to receive a total of two&nbsp;
hundred thousand dollars for damages and interest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:38.320
David celebrates the win from his house while the&nbsp;
lawyer is swarmed by reporters, congratulating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:44.080
him for the win. He expresses his gratitude to his&nbsp;
mother, kids, and accidentally says he is thankful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:49.920
to David as well. When the reporters ask him&nbsp;
who David is, he claims he is his boyfriend. 
&nbsp;

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:54.320
The children are also interviewed about their&nbsp;
thoughts and opinions on Starbuck. They claim that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:58.400
although they wanted to see their father, they&nbsp;
understand if he wants to keep living his life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:03.920
normally. They also declare that Starbuck is not a&nbsp;
freak or a pervert that the media portrays him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:10.400
be. In fact, the children think that he is a nice&nbsp;
man who gave them life and a chance to be happy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:16.160
David watches the interview, regretting that he&nbsp;
cannot be a father to all his biological children.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:20.640
He wants to meet them as their dad but is scared&nbsp;
that he won’t get the compensation money if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:25.760
does so. He meets the lawyer who confirms&nbsp;
that coming out as Starbuck is a great risk.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:30.800
On returning home that day, David finds his&nbsp;
father waiting in the kitchen. As they chat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:36.560
David tells him that he is Starbuck. Unlike what&nbsp;
he has expected, his father isn’t disappointed or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:41.280
sad. In fact, he advises David to tell&nbsp;
everyone the truth. He also hands his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:46.400
son eighty thousand dollars as his part of the&nbsp;
inheritance from the butcher shop. Now that David&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:52.240
has enough money to pay off his debts, he emails&nbsp;
all his children about his true identity.
&nbsp;

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:58.320
That night, Valérie goes into premature labor and&nbsp;
gives birth to a healthy baby boy. David’s father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:03.680
brothers, along with many of his children come to&nbsp;
the hospital to congratulate him. They embrace in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:09.440
a big group hug. David tells Valérie about him&nbsp;
being Starbuck. She freaks out initially but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:15.040
eventually accepts him as he is. The baby gets&nbsp;
numerous presents from all his half-siblings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:19.200
In the end, we see David and the&nbsp;
children in a subway, supporting one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:28.240
of their brothers who is a singer. 
